# Q31 When are two published series the same Named KPI and when different? (series of one measure, with what sets each apart: region, crude leg, RIN treatment, blend)
PREFIX mkt: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/market-data/>
PREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>
SELECT ?measure ?series ?region ?crude ?excludesRIN ?blendOf WHERE {
  ?series mkt:seriesOf ?measure .
  OPTIONAL { ?series mkt:region ?region }
  OPTIONAL { ?series mkt:leg ?leg . ?leg mkt:benchmark ?crude . ?crude mkt:benchmarkKind <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/market-data/benchmark-kind/crude-marker> }
  OPTIONAL { ?series mkt:excludesRINCost ?excludesRIN }
  OPTIONAL { ?series mkt:blendOf ?blendOf }
}
